OL,3,AWarrants used to search Andrew's homes
OL,4,Awere unlawful, court says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former prince, who denies any
OL,7,Fwrongdoing, was arrested by police on
OL,8,F19 February on suspicion of misconduct
OL,9,Fin public office, after which he
OL,10,Flaunched a legal challenge over the
OL,11,Flegality of the search warrants.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
